{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذَا", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "قِيلَ", "translation": "it is said"}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "translation": "to them"}, {"text": "ءَامِنُوا۟", "translation": "Believe"}, {"text": "بِمَآ", "translation": "in what"}, {"text": "أَنزَلَ", "translation": "has revealed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "قَالُوا۟", "translation": "they say"}, {"text": "نُؤْمِنُ", "translation": "We believe"}, {"text": "بِمَآ", "translation": "in what"}, {"text": "أُنزِلَ", "translation": "was revealed"}, {"text": "عَلَيْنَا", "translation": "to us"}, {"text": "وَيَكْفُرُونَ", "translation": "And they disbelieve"}, {"text": "بِمَا", "translation": "in what"}, {"text": "وَرَآءَهُۥ", "translation": "(is) besides it"}, {"text": "وَهُوَ", "translation": "while it"}, {"text": "ٱلْحَقُّ", "translation": "(is) the truth"}, {"text": "مُصَدِّقًۭا", "translation": "confirming"}, {"text": "لِّمَا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "مَعَهُمْ ۗ", "translation": "(is) with them"}, {"text": "قُلْ", "translation": "Say"}, {"text": "فَلِمَ", "translation": "Then why"}, {"text": "تَقْتُلُونَ", "translation": "(did) you kill"}, {"text": "أَنۢبِيَآءَ", "translation": "(the) Prophets"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "قَبْلُ", "translation": "before"}, {"text": "إِن", "translation": "if"}, {"text": "كُنتُم", "translation": "you were"}, {"text": "مُّؤْمِنِينَ", "translation": "believers"}], "sahih": "And when it is said to them, \"Believe in what Allāh has revealed,\" they say, \"We believe [only] in what was revealed to us.\" And they disbelieve in what came after it, while it is the truth confirming that which is with them. Say, \"Then why did you kill the prophets of Allāh before, if you are [indeed] believers?\""}